<meta property="og:title" content="Inbound Student Exchange Programme" />
<meta property="og:description" content="UCSI University welcomes students from any of their partner universities who are eligible to study at UCSI University through their exchange programme. The application and selection process for the exchange programme are run entirely by the students’ home universities.  Therefore, prospective students should apply with the person-in-charge of the student exchange and study abroad programmes through their institution’s International Office.  " />
