rator"></div><div class="kopa-breadcrumb"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><div class="pull-left"><h1>Inbound Student Exchange Programme</h1></div><div class="pull-right"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <section class="kopa-area kopa-area-31"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-3 col-sm-3 col-xs-12 panel-col-thirty"> <nav class="sub-nav-mobile clearfix"><a class="pull"><span class="sub-menu-title"> Sub Menu <span class="fa fa-angle-down padleft-10"></span></span></a><ul class="sub-menu-mobile clearfix"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/about-us/global-engagement-office">About Us</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/international-degree-programme/">International Degree Pathways (IDP)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/geo/transnational-education-partners-tne">Transnational Education Partners (TNE)</a></li><li><a href="#">Student Exchange Programme</a><ul class="menu"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/student-exchange-programme">Overview</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/inbound-student-exchange-programme">Inbound Student Exchange Programme</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/outbound-student-exchange-programme">Outbound Student Exchange Programme</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="http://mobilityprogramme.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/">Student Mobility Programme</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/testimonial/global-engagement-office">Testimonial</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/downloads">Download Brochure</a></li></ul></nav><div class="panel-separator"></div><div class="entity entity-bean bean-custom-content clearfix" about="/block/iucc-sidebar-contact-us" typeof=""><div class="content"><div class="field field-name-field-custom-information field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><div class="panel-separator"></div><div class="widget widget_categories""><h4 class="widget-title"><br>Contact Us</h4><div class="left-side-bar-item"><b>Address</b><p style="font-size:12px">Global Engagement Office (GEO)<br>Block G, Level 10, UCSI University,<br> 1 Jalan UCSI, UCSI Heights (Taman Connaught), Cheras 56000, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.</p><b>Tel</b><p style="font-size:12px">+603 9101 8880 ext. 2066</p><b>Email</b><p style="font-size:12px">Kuala Lumpur: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7b1c1e143b0e1808120e15120d1e0908120f02551e1f0e551602"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="caadafa58abfa9b9a3bfa4a3bcafb8b9a3beb3e4afaebfe4a7b3">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p><p style="font-size:12px">Springhill: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1572707a3b667d556076667c607b7c637067667c616c3b7071603b786c"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="1c7b7973326f745c697f6f756972756a796e6f75686532797869327165">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-9 col-sm-9 col-xs-12 panel-col-seventy"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 panel-col-center"><div class="entry-box"><div class="entry-content"><div class="entry-professor-box"><div class="row clearfix"><div class="entry-professor-content col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><p> UCSI University welcomes students from any of their partner universities who are eligible to study at UCSI University through their exchange programme. The application and selection process for the exchange programme are run entirely by the students’ home universities. Therefore, prospective students should apply with the person-in-charge of the student exchange and study abroad programmes through their institution’s International Office.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class="widget kopa-owl-5-widget"><div class="widget-title widget-title-custom text-center"> <span></span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div></div><div class="kopa-accordion"><div class="panel-group" id="accordion"><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading active"><h4 class="panel-title"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseOne1"> <span class="btn-title"></span> <span class="tab-title">How long?</span> </a></h4></div><div id="collapseOne1" class="panel-collapse collapse in"><div class="panel-body"> One semester or two semesters.</div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseThree1"> <span class="btn-title"></span> <span class="tab-title">How to validate?</span> </a></h4></div><div id="collapseThree1" class="panel-collapse collapse"><div class="panel-body"> Exchange students will usually earn credit for grades that were obtained at UCSI University.</div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseFour1"> <span class="btn-title"></span> <span class="tab-title"> When? </span> </a></h4></div><div id="collapseFour1" class="panel-collapse collapse"><div class="panel-body"><p><strong>January 2024</strong></p><p>Nomination Deadline: 14 September 2023<br /> Document submission deadline: 5 October 2023<br /> Course Selection: First three (3) weeks of each semester</p><p><strong>May 2024</strong></p><p>Nomination Deadline: 11 January 2024<br /> Document submission deadline: 1 February 2024<br /> Course Selection: First three (3) weeks of each semester</p><p><strong>September 2024</strong></p><p>Nomination Deadline: 16 May 2024<br /> Document submission deadline: 6 June 2024<br /> Course Selection: First three (3) weeks of each semester</p><p><strong>January 2025</strong></p><p>Nomination Deadline: 12 September 2024<br /> Document submission deadline: 3 October 2024<br /> Course Selection: First three (3) weeks of each semester</p></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseFive1"> <span class="btn-title"></span> <span class="tab-title">Eligibility?</span> </a></h4></div><div id="collapseFive1" class="panel-collapse collapse"><div class="panel-body"><ul><li>Registered as an active student at home university.</li><li>Must have completed at least one semester of studies in order to be eligible for the exchange programme.</li><li>Good academic performance.</li><li>Have a good command of the English Language (Minimum: IELTS 5.5 and TOEFL 500. If English is the language of instruction at your home university, IELTS and TOEFL is exempted)</li><li>Have a good health condition.</li><li>Must agree to abide by the rules and regulations of UCSI or placement provider.</li><li>Should demonstrate empathy and understanding of cultural difference.</li><li>Should demonstrate excellent personal skills.</li><li>Agrees to be responsible and accountable for the costs incurred.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseSix1"> <span class="btn-title"></span> <span class="tab-title"> Medium of instruction? </span> </a></h4></div><div id="collapseSix1" class="panel-collapse collapse"><div class="panel-body"> All classes in UCSI University are taught in English. Students will be studying alongside regular UCSI University students</div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseSeven1"> <span class="btn-title"></span> <span class="tab-title"> Activities and Support Services? </span> </a></h4></div><div id="collapseSeven1" class="panel-collapse collapse"><div class="panel-body"><p>UCSI Student Affairs and Alumni offer a range of support services for all our international students including the exchange students.</p><p>For more information, please <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/students-activities-and-recreation">click here</a></p></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseEight1"> <span class="btn-title"></span> <span class="tab-title"> Accommodations </span> </a></h4></div><div id="collapseEight1" class="panel-collapse collapse"><div class="panel-body"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/Kuala-Lumpur?display=Kuala-Lumpur">Click here</a> to check the types of accommodation at UCSI University.</div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Contact Us</h4><p> For further enquiries, please email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#8cebe9e3ccf9efffe5f9e2e5fae9feffe5f8f5a2e9e8f9a2e1f5"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="5e393b311e2b3d2d372b3037283b2c2d372a27703b3a2b703327">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </section><div class="panel-panel panel-col-bottom"><div class="inside"><section class="kopa-area-16 kopa-area-parallax"><div class="mask"></div><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><div class="widget kopa-tagline-5-widget"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-10 col-sm-9 col-xs-12"><h3>Want to know more? <span>Contact us today!</span></h3></div><div class="col-md-2 col-sm-3 col-xs-12"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/contact" class="kopa-button pink-button medium-button">Contact Us</a></div></div></div></div></div></div> </section><div class="panel-separator"></div><div class="panel-display panel-3col-33 clearfix" id="mini-panel-bottom_sidebar_v1"><div id="bottom-sidebar"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="panel-panel panel-col-top"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside text-center"><div class="widget kopa-ads-widget-1"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/awards-and-recognition"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/logo-ucsi-footer_v14.png" alt="QS Ranking" /> </a></div></div></div><div class="col-md-3 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside text-center"><img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/logo-ir4.png" alt="Sustainable Development Goals"> &nbsp <a target="_blank" href="http://sdg.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/"><img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/logo-sdg-2.png" alt="Sustainable Development Goals"></a></div></div><div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside"><div class="widget kopa-social-link-widget"><ul class="social-nav model-2 clearfix"><li><a href="http://www.facebook.com/ucsi.university" title="Facebook" class="facebook"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a></li><li><a href="http://www.twitter.com/ucsiuniversity" title="X-Twitter" class="x-twitter"><i class="fab fa-x-twitter"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/ucsiuni/" title="Instagram" class="instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a></li><li><a href="http://www.youtube.com/ucsiuniversity" title="Youtube" class="youtube"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/school/ucsi-education/" title="LinkedIn" class="linkedin"><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@ucsiuni" title="Tiktok" class="tiktok"><i class="fab fa-tiktok"></i></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside"><hr></div></div></div></div><div class="panel-panel panel-col-bottom"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside"><div class="entity entity-bean bean-custom-content clearfix" about="/block/footer-links" typeof=""><div class="content"><div class="field field-name-field-custom-information field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><div class="row"><div class="c