wo"><h5 class="card-header py-3 border-0 text-uppercase text-bold"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo"> Admissions </a></h5></div><div id="collapseTwo" class="collapse" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="headingTwo"><div class="card-block"><ul class="widget-list list-unstyled p-0"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/admission/malaysian-students/overview">Malaysian Students</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/international-students/overview">International Students</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/intakes-and-calendar">Intakes and Calendar</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/exhibitions-and-roadshows/malaysia?display=Malaysia">Exhibitions and Roadshows</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/scholarship-and-financial-aid-malaysian-student">Scholarships & Financial Aid (Malaysian)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/scholarships-international-students">Scholarships & Financial Aid (International)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/payment">Payment</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/downloads">Downloads</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="col-sm-12 col-md-3"><div class="widget widget_footer_menu hidden-xs-down"><h4 class="widget-title widget-title-s10">Life @ UCSI</h4><ul class="widget-list list-unstyled list-unstyle p-0"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/training-and-internship">Training and Internship</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/students-activities-and-recreation/Kuala-Lumpur?display=Kuala-Lumpur-Campus">Students Activities and Recreation</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/student-development-and-counselling">Student Development & Counselling</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/Kuala-Lumpur?display=Kuala-Lumpur-Campus">Accommodation</a></l